  5. NO PASS IS BEING CLAIMED. This report carries no failure element and no
     error element. That absence records only that no failure was observed,
     because no run was performed. It must NOT be read as an assertion that an
     executed baseline run passed. Validation asserts on produced artifacts and
     on captured output, never on an inferred outcome.

  6. TIME VALUES ARE PLACEHOLDERS. Every time attribute below is the structural
